{"name": "Derby Life: Ranch & Race", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"46\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/fccfe1b9566cd971a9ef45883b1b1f71.webp?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"131\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/5341af2c2d8dba6d175018611769f161.avif?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your family's once-famous ranch has fallen into decline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it's on you to raise the ultimate racehorse, outrun a greedy rival, and bring the glory back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/383e014d0b838fae17e55143cd2e29bc.poster.avif?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/383e014d0b838fae17e55143cd2e29bc.webm?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/383e014d0b838fae17e55143cd2e29bc.mp4?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"131\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/175e17810a6ca471e5437f2dc37849a5.avif?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>You're not in the stands. You're in the saddle.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Ride as jockey yourself \u2014 or hire a pro and call the shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Read the track and your rivals to find the winning line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Race the World Tour across iconic cities worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Climb the global rankings to the Hall of Fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/dd91346b423994e2e17826edce2758e6.poster.avif?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/dd91346b423994e2e17826edce2758e6.webm?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/dd91346b423994e2e17826edce2758e6.mp4?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"131\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/014a1cd22faa8727e0fb4975c94ffb58.avif?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Your ranch, your rules \u2014 explore a living open world.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Roam open pastures, deep forests, and sunlit beaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Raise sheep and cattle \u2014 and fend off wild predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Explore hidden forests and dig up buried treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Cast a line off the pier at sunset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/7c9fd6867a944557da0fe966af5591e0.poster.avif?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/7c9fd6867a944557da0fe966af5591e0.webm?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/7c9fd6867a944557da0fe966af5591e0.mp4?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"131\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/5533f65b0d87d302483b8146ca5d8731.avif?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Great racehorses aren\u2019t born \u2014 they\u2019re made.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Breed and tame horses with unique bloodlines and traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Train across flat tracks, hills, and obstacle courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Unlock hidden potential out in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Gear up to customize your horse and boost its stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/9586a1d71f806603555597885e8dc265.poster.avif?t=1787724958\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/9586a1d71f806603555597885e8dc265.webm?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/9586a1d71f806603555597885e8dc265.mp4?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Derby Life: Ranch & Race is where great racehorses are made, not born. Breed, raise, and train your own on a living open-world ranch, then saddle up and race the World Tour. Roam, fish, explore, compete. Your ranch, your horse, your glory.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/56511a2944da68bca4504139778f8f5ab344ee25/header.jpg?t=1787724958", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Horses", "Open World", "Simulation", "Racing", "Exploration", "Immersive Sim"], "developers": "Nexelon", "publishers": "Nexelon", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4402300", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "25 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/scteYGWHSQk", "first_seen": 1787608800.0, "review_rank": 43}